# Admin UI standards (RMAA)

## Shared chrome
- Prefer `AdminPageShell`, `AdminPageHeader`, `AdminFilterBar`, `AdminTableShell`, `AdminDetailLayout`, `AdminBreadcrumb` from `@/components/dashboard/AdminPageShell`.
- Form pages: `DashboardFormPageHeader`, `DashboardSectionHeading`, `dashboardFormCardClass`, `cardContentClass`, `primaryButtonClass` from `@/components/dashboard/dashboardFormStyles`.
- Primary CTA: gold `#E1BB33` / `adminPrimaryBtnClass` / `primaryButtonClass`. Text: `#2F3153` / `#4F5077` / `#6B7280`.
- Cards: white, `rounded-2xl`, border `#E8EAF0` / gray-200, soft shadow. Section headings use icon tile + title + optional subtitle.

## Form controls (mandatory — no page-specific field chrome)
- Use shared primitives only: `@/components/ui/input`, `textarea`, `select`, `button`, `label`, `password-input`.
- Canonical look: **h-14**, **rounded-xl**, soft fill **`#F8FAFC`**, border **`#E5E7EB`**, gold focus ring, labels `#4F5077`.
- Do **not** invent alternate heights (`h-10`/`h-11`), white-only fills, or `rounded-lg` field styles on admin forms.
- Select triggers must be `w-full`. Admin shell CSS under `[data-admin-shell]` enforces the same tokens.

## Images
- **Upload only** in admin. Never offer a free-text Image/Thumbnail/Cover/OG/Poster URL field for images.
- Use `AdminImageUpload` from `@/components/ui/AdminImageUpload` (or existing role-specific uploaders that call `uploadFile` / student photo API).
- Non-image URLs (maps, YouTube, social links) may remain text inputs.

## Consistency
- Do not invent page-specific visual languages. Reuse the same header, section cards, inputs (`rounded-xl`), and gold buttons across super-admin, academy-admin, partner-admin, and branch-manager dashboards.
- List / add-edit / view modules should follow the Events admin pattern when redesigning catalogue-style modules.
